OL,3,GNEWSAUkrainian GCSE will help to
OL,4,A'preserve culture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies from Ukraine living in
OL,7,FCheshire have welcomed plans for a new
OL,8,FUkrainian GCSE, saying it celebrates
OL,9,Ftheir culture while helping children
OL,10,Fbuild a future in the UK.
OL,12,FThe Ukrainian GCSE is set to be
OL,13,Fintroduced for pupils in England, Wales
OL,14,Fand Northern Ireland from September
OL,15,F2028, with the first assessments taking
OL,16,Fplace a year later.
OL,18,FMembers of the Ukrainian Family Hub
OL,19,FWarrington said the move would help
OL,20,Fyoung people maintain links to their
OL,21,Fheritage while gaining a recognised
OL,22,Fqualification.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
